      "side": 1,
      "message": "This and the function below are very similar, is there a way to merge some of the code?\n\nAlso, potentially, each board only needs to implement one, so maybe the other one can be left unsupported to save space.",
      "revId": "5116c2dc9a1ddf8adc0c6232aed2824c73a7b44d",
