        "id": 1275795
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-08-02T13:05:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "packet mode is basic; shm mode is an extended feature.  They are not exclusive.  We cannot easily use meta-programming to separate them.\n\nNACK on \"merge some of the code\", I think it results in too ugly and code (especially 2 ec_response_* are different).\nACK on save space if SHM is not supported.",
