      "writtenOn": "2019-07-31T15:56:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, so there is an overrun if audio_buf_rp \u003d\u003d audio_buf_wp + 1 .\n\nBut what if audio_buf_rp \u003d 0 and audio_buf_wp \u003d AUDIO_BUF_LEN - 1? In this case req \u003d 1 and you don\u0027t detect the overrun. Is that a problem?",
      "revId": "5116c2dc9a1ddf8adc0c6232aed2824c73a7b44d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
