      "message": "No, I\u0027m just talking about the case where audio_buf_wp \u003d\u003d AUDIO_BUF_LEN.\n\nFor example:\naudio_buf_wp \u003d AUDIO_BUF_LEN-3; audio_buf_rp \u003d 200\n  n \u003d 3\n  \u003d\u003e audio_buf_wp \u003d AUDIO_BUF_LEN\n  \u003d\u003e usleep(1000) Why do we sleep 1ms where we just read only 3 bytes, and we know there are 200 bytes that can be read straight away in the buffer?",
